# Rectangular witnesses for the quadratic word action

The columns of `chartRows` are the existing 22 chart columns; `liftedRows`
are their images under the certified bridge h. The twelve 22 by 22 matrices
are the coordinate actions of the seed conjugates. `imageRows` records each
resulting rectangular product. The certificates, rather than this data,
establish all these interpretations.

Conventions and ATLAS attribution: `OrbitCover/source/README.md` and
`TwoCoreCentralizer/source/README.md`. The bit order is unchanged, and the
bridge is applied to columns on the left. See `source/generate.py` here for
witness generation; Python is not part of the proof.
-/

